 "library": {
  "title": "Hisense TV remote with AAA batteries, 190 x 44 mm",
  "description": "A Hisense smart-TV remote (UK layout), 190 x 44 x 18 mm, in four Objects: the shell with a well cut for every key (0.4 mm clearance) and an AAA battery bay underneath with contacts; the keys (power + source, eight streaming keys Disney+ / YouTube / Prime Video / Rakuten Kids / Freely / Netflix / NOW / Apple TV+, colour keys, D-pad with OK, back and home, volume and channel rockers, subtitle / mute / info, numbers 1-9 and 0); two AAA cells; and the battery door, drawn 12 mm below the remote (set its Move Z to 0 to close it).",
